---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import ServicePage from "../components/ServicePage.astro";
import ContactCta from "../components/ContactCta.astro";
import BrandClients from "../components/BrandClients.astro";
import PhotoCarousel from "../components/PhotoCarousel.astro";
import { corporatePhotos } from "../data/corporatePhotos";
---

<SiteLayout title="Connecticut Corporate Event DJ | DJ Rachel Lynch" description="DJ and event-host services for corporate events, brand activations, grand openings, company celebrations, and galas.">
	<ServicePage
		eyebrow="Corporate + brand events"
		title="your brand,<br /><em>your crowd,</em><br />my energy."
		lead={[
			"Store events. Grand openings. Galas. Holiday parties. And everything in between.",
			"Deliberate, never generic. No awkward silences. No off-brand song choices. Nothing forgettable.",
			"Your guests won’t just remember the event. They’ll remember whose it was.",
		]}
		offersHeading="events we can shape together"
		pinkOffers
		offers={[
			{ title: "Retail activations + pop-ups", copy: "In-store events, customer engagement, promotional experiences." },
			{ title: "Grand openings + ribbon cuttings", copy: "Launch celebrations, announcements, and milestone events." },
			{ title: "Company parties, award nights + mixers", copy: "From polished background sound to a dance floor your team still talks about on Monday, I plan every moment around your crowd, so the atmosphere feels right from beginning to end." },
			{ title: "Galas + fundraisers", copy: "The program has to hit. The mission has to land. The finish has to feel like a celebration. I handle the sound for speeches, raffles, and fundraising moments, then bring the music to send your guests home smiling." },
		]}
		steps={[
			{ title: "Share the brief", copy: "Talk through your audience, venue, schedule, and event goals." },
			{ title: "Set the tone", copy: "Choose the music and sound details that fit your brand and run of show." },
			{ title: "Bring it to life", copy: "Enjoy the event while the agreed plan guides the music and mic moments." },
		]}
	>
		<PhotoCarousel slot="hero-media" photos={corporatePhotos} label="Corporate and brand event photos" />
		<div slot="after-hero">
		<section class="section event-story" aria-labelledby="event-story-heading">
			<div class="page-width">
			<h2 id="event-story-heading">Your event has a purpose. <em>Let's make it count.</em></h2>
			<div class="event-story__copy">
				<p>Whether you're celebrating your team, launching a product, welcoming customers, or bringing people together around your brand, the entertainment should do more than fill the silence.</p>
				<p>It should support what you're trying to accomplish.</p>
				<p>I work with you to understand your audience, your objectives, and the experience you want to create. From the music and microphone work to event flow and technical details, every element should have a purpose.</p>
				<p>Sometimes that means creating excitement and drawing a crowd. Other times it means supporting a presentation, keeping guests engaged, or bringing the right energy without becoming the center of attention.</p>
				<p>Professional when it matters. Energetic when it counts. Always focused on making your event a success.</p>
			</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<BrandClients />
		</div>
		<ContactCta />
	</ServicePage>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
	.event-story { background: #000; color: #fff; }
	.event-story h2 { color: #fff; font-weight: 900; text-transform: none; }
	.event-story h2 em { color: var(--pink); }
	.event-story__copy { max-width: 800px; margin-top: 32px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
